5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! Let's all work together to find the werewolf and keep each other safe! I'm looking forward to getting to know you all!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,...Hello.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Let's keep the discussion logical. We need to identify patterns in how people speak to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Let us be kind to one another, even in these difficult times.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help the village. Let's try to maintain a good atmosphere!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,Right! A positive attitude is the best way to start! Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they want to share?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,I suggest we pay close attention to who is trying too hard to steer the conversation or who is being overly vague.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a very sensible approach, Asuka dear. It is always wise to be observant.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. I'll listen carefully to everyone. I hope we can all trust each other.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll be listening too! I really want us all to survive this. We can do it if we support each other!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,...I'll try my best.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,Trust is a luxury we cannot afford until we have evidence. Let's focus on the facts.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, Asuka. A little bit of trust can be a wonderful thing. It helps the heart feel lighter.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I think a balance of both is good. We should be careful, but also kind to one another.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Exactly! Let's be careful but kind! I'm ready for whatever happens next. Good luck to everyone!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,...Good luck.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Over"",""raw"":""Over.""}],""raw"":""Over.""}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,I wish you all a peaceful night. Please take care of yourselves.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,I hope everyone has a safe night. I'll see you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
