31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Good morning! I hope everyone slept well. I'm still feeling positive! Let's find the werewolf together today!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,...Good morning.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The night has passed. If the Seer has found something, now is the time to consider how to use that information without exposing themselves.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, dear ones. I am glad to see your faces again. I hope you all feel rested.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning. I was a little worried during the night, but I'm glad we're all here.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm feeling really good about our group! Does anyone feel like something is off, or does everyone seem okay so far?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,...I'm not sure.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, your lack of engagement is noted. It could be your personality, or it could be a tactic to avoid scrutiny.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Now, Asuka, let's not be too hard on Daisuke. Some people are just naturally quiet, and that is perfectly alright.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue. We shouldn't jump to conclusions just because someone is shy. I can be shy too!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,That's right! Let's be patient with each other. I believe in all of you! Let's try to look for clues together.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,...Sorry. I'm just... not good at this.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Apologies are not evidence. I am simply analyzing the behavior of the group. If anyone is the Seer, please be careful.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"You are very diligent, Asuka. It is a wonderful trait, as long as it is tempered with a little gentleness.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I think we should try to talk more. Maybe if we share more about ourselves, it will be easier to tell who is lying.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"That's a great idea, Midori! Let's keep talking and sharing. I'm sure we can figure this out with a smile!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,...I'll try to talk more.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I have no more to add for now. I will observe the voting patterns.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I believe in the goodness of people. Let us proceed with a warm heart.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll do my best to help everyone feel comfortable. Let's make a careful decision.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
