64,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Daisuke is gone. He was too quiet to be useful, but his execution doesn't necessarily mean we found the werewolf.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, it is so sad to lose someone. I hope he is at peace now. My heart goes out to him.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Midori,,I feel terrible that we voted for him. He was just shy... and now Yumi is gone too. This is getting scary.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"Yumi's death is a significant loss of noise, but a gain in clarity. We are now down to three people.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is very frightening indeed, Midori. But we must stay strong for each other. We are all that is left.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, you seem so cold about this. Do you really not feel anything for our friends?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"Emotions do not solve the problem. We have a werewolf among us. If the Seer is still alive, they should speak now.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"Perhaps a little kindness would help us think more clearly, Asuka. We are all frightened.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Midori,,I just want this to end. I don't want anyone else to get hurt.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"If neither of you is the Seer, then the werewolf is simply waiting for the numbers to even out. I suspect Midori.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, let us not be so quick to accuse. Midori has been very sweet. Let us think carefully.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Midori,,Me?! I'm just a villager! I've tried to be helpful and kind to everyone!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
